== requests
  200 "GET a=1 \"\"\n"
  200 "PUT  \"hello\"\n"
  413 "too large\n"
  200 ""
  200 "one two three" (chunked)
  404 "not found\n"
== keep-alive
  same connection: true
  new connection after close: true
== stall
  transient/link:  no progress for 0.5s
  200 "late\n"
== redial after the server dropped an idle connection
  200 "GET after=restart \"\"\n"
== nothing listening
  transient/link
